# Private maintainer tooling, deliberately NOT in the public repo.
# graphify builds a local knowledge graph of this codebase; graph.json is
# derived data rewritten whole on every build, and .gitattributes only works
# in a clone that has the merge driver configured. .claude/ pins an absolute
# path to one machine. Collaborators clone the tool and the data, not this.
graphify-out/
.graphifyignore
.gitattributes
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
